> par8(x: u8) = popcount(x) & 1
> parbits(x: u8) = (x&1) xor ((x>>1)&1) xor ((x>>2)&1) xor ((x>>3)&1) xor ((x>>4)&1) xor ((x>>5)&1) xor ((x>>6)&1) xor ((x>>7)&1)
> equiv par8 parbits
par8 and parbits are equal on the domain of par8 (exhaustive)
> lt(x: u8) = ((x & 0x55) << 1) | ((x & 0xaa) >> 1)
> equiv lt lt
lt and lt are equal on the domain of lt (exhaustive)
> bad(x: u8) = par8(x) + 1
> equiv bad par8
bad and par8 differ at 256 points, e.g. x=0: 1 vs 0
